~ jayce_keycard_flash
# step 2.274: the seduction route. fiona flashes him (off-screen); he unlocks dr. greene's office and
# leaves for the day. sets jayce_flashed (chapter memory -> kb_jayce_flashed for the car ride),
# greene_office_unlocked and jayce_gone (the level removes him from his post when this dialogue ends).
do actor_change("Jayce", "base")
do actor_change("Fiona", "suspicious")
Player: (Yep... only one way to get sleazebags like him to do anything.)
do actor_change("Layla", "surprised")
You clutch the lower half of your crop top and pull it up.
# step 2.402: fiona's flash pose (her rig's flash body).
# (Layla's cues: step 2.374. Jayce's: step 2.395.)
# step 2.404: his theme stops dead at the flash, with the record winding down (the fade as he leaves
# brings the ambience back)
do SoundManager.cut_music()
do SoundManager.play_sfx("vinyl_stop", 1.0, 0.0, "Main Music")
do actor_change("Fiona", "flash")
do actor_change("Jayce", "stunned")
do actor_effect("Jayce", "shock")
Jayce: They're...
if Flags.get_level_flag("party_companion_staged") == true and Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 0:
	# close / neutral: she short-circuits (her funny face, with the red flush)
	do actor_change("Layla", "funny_face")
	do actor_effect("Layla", "shock")
	Layla: So...
	# step 2.434: both at once: a punch on each as the line lands, both names in their colours, both faces
	do actor_pop("Layla", 0.12, 0.35, false)
	do actor_pop("Jayce", 0.12, 0.35, false)
	Layla & Jayce: Perfect!!!
else
	Jayce: ...Perfect.
	if Flags.get_level_flag("party_companion_staged") == true:
		do actor_change("Layla", "downcast")
		do actor_effect("Layla", "turn_away")
		Layla looks away.
do Flags.set_level_flag("jayce_flashed", true)
if Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 0:
	do actor_change("Layla", "flustered")
do actor_change("Fiona", "base")
You pull your top back down.
Player: Well, there you have it.
do actor_change("Jayce", "sorry")
do actor_change("Fiona", "explain")
Player: You got something out of this.
Player: Here's what you'll do now: You'll go up and unlock Professor Greene's office for us.
Player: Then, you'll go back to your place. Immediately.
Player: We don't want you around here anymore. At least for the rest of the day.
do actor_change("Jayce", "sorry_talk")
Jayce: Y-yes, ma'am.
Jayce: That's what I'll do.
do actor_change("Jayce", "sorry")
do actor_change("Fiona", "suspicious")
Player: (Huh... he's agreeable all of a sudden.)
do Flags.set_level_flag("jayce_gone", true)
do SoundManager.fade_out_music(2.0)
do party_dismiss()
Jayce scurries away, practically hopping.
do Flags.set_level_flag("greene_office_unlocked", true)
do Flags.set_level_flag("greene_office_entry_pending", true)
if Flags.get_level_flag("party_companion_staged") == true:
